{"title":"Frozen Tree???","slug":"Frozen_Tree%3F%3F%3F","hero":{"file":"FrozenTree.webp","width":400,"height":643},"pageid":4868,"revid":20953,"timestamp":"2025-12-28T18:08:43Z","lastEditor":"Lildogeramen123","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Wood","fields":[{"label":"Log","value":"$1/stud"},{"label":"Sanded","value":"$1/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.97.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"25/12/2025"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"},{"label":"Planked","value":"$1.2/stud"},{"label":"title","value":"Frozen Tree"}]},"sections":[{"id":"obtaining","text":"Obtaining"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"obtaining\">Obtaining</h2>\n<p><b>Frozen Trees</b> can be obtained by using the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Icethrower/\">Icethrower</a> on any tree which is obtainable by opening the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gift_of_Frozen_Flames/\">Gift of Frozen Flames</a>. It works similar to the process of using a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a> to turn any tree into an <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ash_Tree/\">Ash Tree</a>. When using the Icethrower on a tree the tree emits blue fire particles around it until after a few seconds it turns into a Frozen Tree.\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Frozen Tree\">Frozen Tree</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Frozen Tree\">Frozen Tree</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Frozen_Tree.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>"}
